{"id":"msg_m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_rosanna","label":"Rosanna · Nikke"},"label":"6. Mister.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_02","next":null,"speakers":{"rosanna_s":"Rosanna"},"icons":{"rosanna_s":"si_c283_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_1","text":"Mister.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_2","text":"Tell me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_3","text":"is that cream you gave me last time sunscreen?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_4","text":"It is. Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_5","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_6","text":"Are you sure?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_7","text":"The more I put on, the darker my skin seems to get.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_8","text":"Hold on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_9","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_9","text":"Glancing at the top of my desk,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_10","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_10","text":"I see the bottle of sunscreen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_11","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_11","text":"I must have accidentally sent the tanning cream Anis bought on a whim...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_12","text":"I think what you've got there is tanning cream.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_13","text":"I knew it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_14","text":"But it's not a big deal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_15","text":"Sorry, I'll send you the sunscreen later.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_16","text":"Rather than that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_17","text":"why don't you make it up to me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_18","text":"How?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_19","text":"I've already applied the cream,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_20","text":"but there are still some areas I can't quite reach.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_21","text":"Surely someone like yourself could lend a hand?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_22","text":"Sure, I'll help out.","jump":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_24"},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_23","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_23","text":"Can't you ask one of your subordinates?","jump":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_28"},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_24","text":"That's what I wanted to hear.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_25","text":"I'm always thrilled to have an excuse to meet you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_26","text":"and a private meeting at that!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_27","text":"Where should we meet?","jump":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_34"},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_28","text":"Hmm?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_29","text":"If you're not into it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_30","text":"I won't force you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_31","text":"But I can't promise what will happen to the hand","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_32","text":"of any subordinate who dares lay a hand on me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_33","text":"... Okay, I'll do it.","jump":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_34"},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_34","text":"All right, there are too many prying eyes out here,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_35","text":"so I'll book a hotel room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_36","text":"I wouldn't want you to be in a tough spot ^_^","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_37","text":"Aren't I thoughtful?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_38","text":"You're the best. Thanks, Rosanna.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_39","text":"Let's kick things off with a shot of whiskey and set the mood right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_40","text":"Btw, it's Room 706.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_41","text":"I'll be waiting,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_03_42","text":"so don't be late.","jump":null}],"chat":true}